      "contents": " Masrur Hossain Siam Mobile \u0026amp; Software Application Developer | SaaS Architect | Prompt Engineer\nEmail: seaimmolla@gmail.com\nLocation: Narayanganj\nPhone: +8801812497901\n🎯 Career Objective To secure a professional role as a Mobile Application Developer or Software Developer where I can apply my technical expertise in building scalable SaaS solutions and high-performance mobile apps. I am dedicated to delivering high-quality digital products that create real-world value through clean logic and innovative design.\n🛠 Core Technical Skills Development \u0026amp; Architecture Mobile Development: Expert-level proficiency in Java and Kotlin for Android. SaaS \u0026amp; Backend: Experienced in building Multi-tenant architectures, PHP (8.x), and Python for automation and backend logic. Modern Web: Designing responsive interfaces with Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS. Database \u0026amp; Cloud: Proficient in PostgreSQL, MySQL, and Supabase (Storage \u0026amp; Edge Functions). AI \u0026amp; Workflow Optimization Prompt Engineering: Structuring advanced AI workflows, prompt chaining, and refinement for accurate and context-aware outputs. Automation: Leveraging AI tools and Deno scripts for server-side automation and data purging. 🚀 Featured Projects QShare – Privacy-First File Sharing SaaS Engineered an ultra-fast platform where files automatically self-destruct after 5 minutes. Implemented an Auto-Purge Engine using Supabase Edge Functions and Cron jobs. Integrated QR Code systems for seamless cross-device file sharing. CalcHubBD – Pro Suite (60+ Tools) Developed a versatile calculation platform with over 60+ specialized tools for financial, academic, and business needs. Optimized for regional standards (BD market) with a modern, card-based UI/UX. ShopMaster SaaS – Inventory \u0026amp; Sales Logic Built a high-performance inventory management system with secure multi-user access and private data silos. Designed a real-time business intelligence dashboard to track revenue and low-stock alerts. 💼 Professional Experience Independent Software Developer Project Validation: Managing complete application flows from initial idea to final implementation. Full-Stack Implementation: Handling user authentication, API integration, and performance optimization for web and mobile platforms. AI Integration: Using AI models to support development planning, debugging, and advanced content generation. 🎓 Education Bachelor of Science in Computer Science \u0026amp; Engineering Green University of Bangladesh (Currently Studying) Higher Secondary Certificate (HSC) Dania College University (Group: Science) 📜 Certifications \u0026amp; Training Web Development: HTML \u0026amp; CSS for Web Development (Fundamentals). Business \u0026amp; Communication: Public Speaking \u0026amp; Communication Skills (10 Minute School). Marketing: Digital Marketing Essentials (10 Minute School). Personal Development: Yoga Training \u0026amp; Psychology Fundamentals (Quantum Method). 🤝 Volunteer Work \u0026amp; Leadership Community Tech Support: Helping local small businesses digitize their inventory systems. Campus Tech Mentor: Assisting fellow students at Green University of Bangladesh with logic building and mobile app development. Quantum Method Volunteer: Active participant in community well-being and social service programs. 🎯 Strengths \u0026amp; Professional Qualities Analytical Mindset: Strong logical problem-solving skills and attention to detail. Fast Learner: Ability to quickly adapt to new frameworks (e.g., Supabase, Next.js). Self-Discipline: Highly motivated to work independently and manage complex project timelines. ",
